#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>リトルシャーレアンの、シャルモンは考え込んでいる。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Charmont ist tief in Gedanken versunken.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Charmont a besoin d'un cobay... d'un<if $gn4>e</if> collaborat<if $gn4>rice<else>eur</if> pour tester sa dernière invention.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
